  "ENDTXT": {
   "0": {
    "en": "~V08~H17    The last foe@lies dead behind@you.  but   your@instincts   warn@that  all is not@as it should be.@In  the   nearby@cliff   face.  a@huge  stone door@has    appeared!@    Approaching@it   cautiously.@you  insert  and@turn   the   key@",
    "zh": "~V08~H17　最後一個敵人@已倒在你身後，@但直覺告訴你，@事情並不對勁。@就在附近的@崖壁上，@出現了一道@巨大的石門！@　你小心翼翼@地走近，插入@並轉動了那把@鑰匙——"
   },
   "1": {
    "en": "Dundle gave you.~V8A~H01An enormous groan begins  -  the sound@of machinery.  The massive door swings@open.  revealing a torchlit labyrinth.@    Stepping warily into the cave. you@prepare  to  meet whatever enemy might@be waiting.",
    "zh": "那是丹德爾給你的。~V8A~H01一聲低沉的巨響傳來——那是機械的聲音。@厚重的門緩緩開啟，露出一座火炬照亮的迷宮。@　你戒慎地踏進洞穴，@準備迎接任何可能等在裡面的敵人。"
   },
   "2": {
    "en": "~V08~H01   The maze of tunnels leads relent-@lessly downward, until  it seems you@must tread within  the very heart of@the mountain.@ @ @Water    oozes@through cracks@in  the  rocky@ground.@Stagnant pools@and     slime-@covered  rocks@",
    "zh": "~V08~H01　隧道構成的迷宮不斷向下延伸，直到你彷彿@得走進這座山的心臟深處。@ @ @水從岩地的@裂縫滲出。@死水窪與@覆滿黏泥的@岩石，@"
   },
   "3": {
    "en": "make the foot-@ing  uncertain@at best.~V9C~H01   Hours  pass,  and you find yourself@growing tired.  Your torchlight wanes.@You  begin  to  wonder if this maze of@tunnels will ever end.@",
    "zh": "讓每一步都@踩不踏實。~V9C~H01　一小時一小時過去，你開始感到疲倦。@火炬的光逐漸微弱。@你開始懷疑這座隧道迷宮@究竟有沒有盡頭。@"
   },
   "4": {
    "en": "~V04~H01   Daylight  is  only  a  fond  memory@when,  at last,  the   passage   turns@sharply  to  the  left  and  ends at a@rusty iron door!   Using what strength@you  can  muster,  you  press  against@",
    "zh": "~V04~H01　日光已經成了遙遠的記憶，通道終於@向左急轉，盡頭是一道生鏽的鐵門！@你使出所有還擠得出來的力氣，@抵住那片冰冷的鐵——@"
   },
   "5": {
    "en": "~V94~H01the  cold  iron.   With  a loud creak,@the  ancient door relents and you find@yourself before an ebony stairway.  As@you mount the stairs, you faintly hear@labored breathing and muttered oaths.@",
    "zh": "~V94~H01隨著一聲刺耳的嘎吱，這道古老的門終於@讓步，你眼前出現一道烏木階梯。@拾級而上時，你隱約聽見粗重的喘息@與低聲的咒罵。@"
   },
   "6": {
    "en": "~V04~H00   Quickening your pace, you bolt into a@dimly lit chamber. A large, unshaven man@struggles against the stout chains which@bind him to the wall.@ \"Who has Pildar sent to test me now?\" @~H18he demands.     @\"I   will   pity@your  souls when@",
    "zh": "~V04~H00　你加快腳步，衝進一間光線昏暗的石室。@一個高大、滿臉鬍碴的男人正掙扎著@對抗把他鎖在牆上的粗重鎖鏈。@「這次皮爾達又派誰來試探我了？」@~H18他喝問道。　　@「等我的追隨者@來的時候，我會@"
   },
   "7": {
    "en": "my     followers@come!\"  You look@at him and  ask,@\"Who would those@followers be?\"  @Glaring  at  you@he says \"Any who@count themselves@on  the side  of@Seggallion!\" @ @~H01Puzzled for  a  moment,  you  suddenly@exclaim,  \"WE follow him!\"@",
    "zh": "憐憫你們的@靈魂！」你看@著他，問道：@「那些追隨者@會是誰？」　@他瞪著你說：@「任何自認@站在塞加利昂@這一邊的人！」@ @~H01你怔了一下，忽然喊了出來：@「我們就是追隨他的人！」@"
   },
   "8": {
    "en": "He  looks  at you and smiles \"Well met@then!  I  am  he! Quickly,  free  me.\"@",
    "zh": "他看著你，笑了。「那就幸會了！@我就是他！快，把我放開。」@"
   },
   "9": {
    "en": "~V08~H01   Using  your@weapons,   you@free  him from@the  chains as@you   discribe@how  you  came@to be here.   @   Rubbing his@chafed wrists,@Seggallion    @begins      to@speak, and the@import  of his@words    chill@you.",
    "zh": "~V08~H01　你用手上的@武器把他從@鎖鏈中解開，@一邊說明你們@是怎麼來到@這裡的。　　@　塞加利昂@揉著磨破的@手腕，開口@說話，而他@話裡的份量@讓你渾身@發冷。"
   },
   "10": {
    "en": "~V8C~H01\"I  congratulate you.   Your exploits@thus far have kept the realm safe, but@an  even  more  perilous  journey lies@ahead.   Duke Fuquan  must be informed@of my capture - and warned of Pildar\"s@treachery. You must be my voice!\"@",
    "zh": "~V8C~H01「我要恭喜你們。你們至今的作為保住了@這片王國，但前方還有更凶險的旅程。@必須讓富匡公爵知道我被囚禁的事——@並警告他皮爾達的背叛。@你們得替我傳話！」@"
   },
   "11": {
    "en": "~V08~H01     \"Pildar will surely seek to throw@Ashtalarea into chaos.   I will remain@here  to safeguard the realm until you@return with the Duke.\"@~H19  Holding your@gaze with eyes@of blue steel,@Seggallion@pauses  for  a@moment,@measuring you.@",
    "zh": "~V08~H01　「皮爾達必定會設法把阿什塔拉瑞亞@推入混亂。我會留在這裡守護這片國土，@直到你們帶著公爵回來。」@~H19　塞加利昂以@藍鋼般的眼神@盯住你，@停頓了片刻，@掂量著你們。@"
   },
   "12": {
    "en": "Apparently,@you  pass  his@test,  for  he@continues.@  \"I  dare not@breathe a word@of this to the@~H01nobility, but I fear the whole Kingdom@is at stake!  After alerting the Duke,@journey  throughout  the lands and win@",
    "zh": "看來你們@通過了他的@試探，他@接著說：@　「這件事@我不敢向貴族@透露半個字，@~H01但我怕整個王國都危在旦夕！@通知公爵之後，走遍各地，@贏得任何@"
   },
   "13": {
    "en": "the trust of any who will join us!\"",
    "zh": "願意加入我們的人的信任！」"
   },
   "14": {
    "en": "~V04~H01   Seggallion  rises.   \"You  have  my@thanks,  brave  ones, but I must be on@my  way  before  Pildar  does any more@harm.\"   He pauses at the door.@~V28~H01   \"Dundle    @must know that@I   am  free.\"@He   bends  to@pick   up  the@",
    "zh": "~V04~H01　塞加利昂站起身。「多謝你們，勇敢的人；@但在皮爾達造成更多傷害之前，@我得上路了。」他在門邊停下腳步。@~V28~H01　「得讓丹德爾@知道我自由了。」@他彎腰撿起@那副曾經@"
   },
   "15": {
    "en": "shackles  that@bound     him.@\"Take these to@him  as proof.@I  will muster@my knights and@ride  for  the@Dark Tower.\"@~V94~H01   With  a   wave,  Seggallion  plunges@into  the darkness beyond.  You journey@back   through  the cave, contemplating@",
    "zh": "銬住他的@腳鐐。@「把這個帶去@給他當憑證。@我要集結我的@騎士，馳往@黑暗之塔。」@~V94~H01　塞加利昂揮了揮手，投身進門外的黑暗。@你們穿過洞穴往回走，心裡想著@"
   },
   "16": {
    "en": "the  end of one saga, and the beginning@of another...",
    "zh": "一段傳奇的結束，以及另一段的開始……"
   },
   "17": {
    "en": "\\x00",
    "zh": "\u0000",
    "note": "原版的結束標記，不是文字。"
   }
  }
 }
